{"id":"c3537edf2017d84e","group":"58","path":"58/batch15/58-df-chain-complex.md","title":"Chain Complex","display":"df-chain-complex — Chain Complex","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-chain-complex","aliases":["58-df-chain-complex","Chain Complex"],"display":"df-chain-complex — Chain Complex","depends_on":["[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[58-df-abelian-group]]","[[58-df-homomorphism]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-chain-complex"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-chain-complex</span><span>Chain Complex</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-chain-complex — Chain Complex"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9f54a13cf4872f4e\" href=\"?note=9f54a13cf4872f4e\" title=\"58-df-abelian-group\">58-df-abelian-group</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f32a973b59a825e4\" href=\"?note=f32a973b59a825e4\" title=\"58-df-homomorphism\">58-df-homomorphism</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb Z\">\\(\\mathbb Z\\)</span> (integer index set)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}(C,\\mathbb Z,\\operatorname{ran}(C))\\land\\mathrm{Function}(+,\\mathbb Z,\\operatorname{ran}(+))\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\partial,\\mathbb Z,\\operatorname{ran}(\\partial))\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}(C,\\mathbb Z,\\operatorname{ran}(C))\\land\\mathrm{Function}(+,\\mathbb Z,\\operatorname{ran}(+))\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\partial,\\mathbb Z,\\operatorname{ran}(\\partial))\\)</span> (families of carrier sets, group operations, and boundary maps)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AbelianGroup}_S(G,+_G)\">\\(\\mathrm{AbelianGroup}_S(G,+_G)\\)</span> (abelian-group predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"9f54a13cf4872f4e\" href=\"?note=9f54a13cf4872f4e\" title=\"58-df-abelian-group\">58-df-abelian-group</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GroupHomomorphism}_S(f,G,+_G,H,+_H)\">\\(\\mathrm{GroupHomomorphism}_S(f,G,+_G,H,+_H)\\)</span> (group-homomorphism predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"f32a973b59a825e4\" href=\"?note=f32a973b59a825e4\" title=\"58-df-homomorphism\">58-df-homomorphism</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZeroElement}_S(z,G,+_G)\">\\(\\mathrm{ZeroElement}_S(z,G,+_G)\\)</span> (zero-element predicate defined here)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ChainComplex}_S(C,+,\\partial)\">\\(\\mathrm{ChainComplex}_S(C,+,\\partial)\\)</span> (链复形谓词 defined here)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CycleGroup}_S(n;C,+,\\partial)\">\\(\\mathrm{CycleGroup}_S(n;C,+,\\partial)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BoundaryGroup}_S(n;C,\\partial)\">\\(\\mathrm{BoundaryGroup}_S(n;C,\\partial)\\)</span> (cycle and boundary subgroups defined here)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C_* =\\langle C,+\\rangle\">\\(C_* =\\langle C,+\\rangle\\)</span> 为二参数调用中的分次阿贝尔群数据编码；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ChainComplex}_S(C_*,\\partial)\">\\(\\mathrm{ChainComplex}_S(C_*,\\partial)\\)</span> 与三参数形式按元数区分。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}chain\\text{-}complex\\text{-}zero}\\vdash \\mathrm{ZeroElement}_S(z,G,+_G)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Function}(+_G,G\\times G,G)\\land z\\in G\\land\\forall x\\in G\\;\\left(+_G(\\langle z,x\\rangle)=x\\land +_G(\\langle x,z\\rangle)=x\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}chain\\text{-}complex\\text{-}zero}\\vdash \\mathrm{ZeroElement}_S(z,G,+_G)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Function}(+_G,G\\times G,G)\\land z\\in G\\land\\forall x\\in G\\;\\left(+_G(\\langle z,x\\rangle)=x\\land +_G(\\langle x,z\\rangle)=x\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}chain\\text{-}complex} \\vdash \\mathrm{ChainComplex}_S(C,+,\\partial)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Function}(C,\\mathbb Z,\\operatorname{ran}(C))\\land\\mathrm{Function}(+,\\mathbb Z,\\operatorname{ran}(+))\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\partial,\\mathbb Z,\\operatorname{ran}(\\partial))\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb Z\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{AbelianGroup}_S(C(n),+(n))\\land\\mathrm{GroupHomomorphism}_S(\\partial(n),C(n),+(n),C(n-1),+(n-1))\\land\\exists z\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{ZeroElement}_S(z,C(n-2),+(n-2))\\land\\forall x\\in C(n)\\;(\\partial(n-1)(\\partial(n)(x))=z)\\bigr)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}chain\\text{-}complex} \\vdash \\mathrm{ChainComplex}_S(C,+,\\partial)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Function}(C,\\mathbb Z,\\operatorname{ran}(C))\\land\\mathrm{Function}(+,\\mathbb Z,\\operatorname{ran}(+))\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\partial,\\mathbb Z,\\operatorname{ran}(\\partial))\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb Z\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{AbelianGroup}_S(C(n),+(n))\\land\\mathrm{GroupHomomorphism}_S(\\partial(n),C(n),+(n),C(n-1),+(n-1))\\land\\exists z\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{ZeroElement}_S(z,C(n-2),+(n-2))\\land\\forall x\\in C(n)\\;(\\partial(n-1)(\\partial(n)(x))=z)\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}chain\\text{-}complex\\text{-}cycles} \\vdash n\\in\\mathbb Z\\to \\mathrm{CycleGroup}_S(n;C,+,\\partial)\\coloneqq\\{x\\in C(n):\\exists z\\;(\\mathrm{ZeroElement}_S(z,C(n-1),+(n-1))\\land\\partial(n)(x)=z)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}chain\\text{-}complex\\text{-}cycles} \\vdash n\\in\\mathbb Z\\to \\mathrm{CycleGroup}_S(n;C,+,\\partial)\\coloneqq\\{x\\in C(n):\\exists z\\;(\\mathrm{ZeroElement}_S(z,C(n-1),+(n-1))\\land\\partial(n)(x)=z)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}chain\\text{-}complex\\text{-}boundaries} \\vdash n\\in\\mathbb Z\\to \\mathrm{BoundaryGroup}_S(n;C,\\partial)\\coloneqq\\{\\partial(n+1)(y):y\\in C(n+1)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}chain\\text{-}complex\\text{-}boundaries} \\vdash n\\in\\mathbb Z\\to \\mathrm{BoundaryGroup}_S(n;C,\\partial)\\coloneqq\\{\\partial(n+1)(y):y\\in C(n+1)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ChainComplex}_S(C_*,\\partial)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists C,+\\in V\\;\\Bigl(C_*=\\langle C,+\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{ChainComplex}_S(C,+,\\partial)\\Bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ChainComplex}_S(C_*,\\partial)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists C,+\\in V\\;\\Bigl(C_*=\\langle C,+\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{ChainComplex}_S(C,+,\\partial)\\Bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>A chain complex consists of abelian groups and group homomorphisms whose consecutive composites are zero.</li>\n<li>Exact: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H_n = 0\">\\(H_n = 0\\)</span> means exactness</li>\n<li>Acyclic: all homology groups vanish</li>\n<li>Examples: singular chain complex, CW chain complex</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Hatcher, Algebraic Topology</li>\n<li>Rotman, An Introduction to Algebraic Topology</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-abelian-group","status":"resolved","id":"9f54a13cf4872f4e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-abelian-group]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-homomorphism","status":"resolved","id":"f32a973b59a825e4","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-homomorphism]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-abelian-group","status":"resolved","id":"9f54a13cf4872f4e","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{AbelianGroup}_S(G,+_G)$ (abelian-group predicate, see [[58-df-abelian-group]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-homomorphism","status":"resolved","id":"f32a973b59a825e4","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{GroupHomomorphism}_S(f,G,+_G,H,+_H)$ (group-homomorphism predicate, see [[58-df-homomorphism]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbb Z","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}(C,\\mathbb Z,\\operatorname{ran}(C))\\land\\mathrm{Function}(+,\\mathbb Z,\\operatorname{ran}(+))\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\partial,\\mathbb Z,\\operatorname{ran}(\\partial))","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{AbelianGroup}_S(G,+_G)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GroupHomomorphism}_S(f,G,+_G,H,+_H)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZeroElement}_S(z,G,+_G)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ChainComplex}_S(C,+,\\partial)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CycleGroup}_S(n;C,+,\\partial)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BoundaryGroup}_S(n;C,\\partial)","display":false},{"tex":"C_* =\\langle C,+\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ChainComplex}_S(C_*,\\partial)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}chain\\text{-}complex\\text{-}zero}\\vdash \\mathrm{ZeroElement}_S(z,G,+_G)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Function}(+_G,G\\times G,G)\\land z\\in G\\land\\forall x\\in G\\;\\left(+_G(\\langle z,x\\rangle)=x\\land +_G(\\langle x,z\\rangle)=x\\right)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}chain\\text{-}complex} \\vdash \\mathrm{ChainComplex}_S(C,+,\\partial)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Function}(C,\\mathbb Z,\\operatorname{ran}(C))\\land\\mathrm{Function}(+,\\mathbb Z,\\operatorname{ran}(+))\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\partial,\\mathbb Z,\\operatorname{ran}(\\partial))\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb Z\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{AbelianGroup}_S(C(n),+(n))\\land\\mathrm{GroupHomomorphism}_S(\\partial(n),C(n),+(n),C(n-1),+(n-1))\\land\\exists z\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{ZeroElement}_S(z,C(n-2),+(n-2))\\land\\forall x\\in C(n)\\;(\\partial(n-1)(\\partial(n)(x))=z)\\bigr)\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}chain\\text{-}complex\\text{-}cycles} \\vdash n\\in\\mathbb Z\\to \\mathrm{CycleGroup}_S(n;C,+,\\partial)\\coloneqq\\{x\\in C(n):\\exists z\\;(\\mathrm{ZeroElement}_S(z,C(n-1),+(n-1))\\land\\partial(n)(x)=z)\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}chain\\text{-}complex\\text{-}boundaries} \\vdash n\\in\\mathbb Z\\to \\mathrm{BoundaryGroup}_S(n;C,\\partial)\\coloneqq\\{\\partial(n+1)(y):y\\in C(n+1)\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ChainComplex}_S(C_*,\\partial)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists C,+\\in V\\;\\Bigl(C_*=\\langle C,+\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{ChainComplex}_S(C,+,\\partial)\\Bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"H_n = 0","display":false}],"bytes":2967,"backlinks":[{"id":"1f71a0c5b8ef86ca","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{AbelianGroup}_S$, $\\mathrm{GroupHomomorphism}_S$, and $\\mathrm{ZeroElement}_S$（see [[../batch15/58-df-chain-complex.md]]）"},{"id":"d66edfb2b33caae5","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"d9f6d19a1e737076","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{BoundaryGroup}$、$\\mathrm{CycleGroup}$ 取 [[../batch15/58-df-chain-complex.md]] 的同名定义与参数次序。"},{"id":"76a17cf51da75e1a","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"025c5240f130d970","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ChainComplex}_S$, $\\mathrm{CycleGroup}_S$, $\\mathrm{BoundaryGroup}_S$, and $\\mathrm{ZeroElement}_S$ are from [[../batch15/58-df-chain-complex.md]]."},{"id":"434d3c43afd7cf17","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ChainComplex}_S(C,+_C,d_C)$, $\\mathrm{CycleGroup}_S(n;C,+_C,d_C)$, and $\\mathrm{BoundaryGroup}_S(n;C,d_C)$ are from [[../batch15/58-df-chain-complex.md]]."},{"id":"03f2d34d9851bee4","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZeroElement}_S(z,G,+_G)$ (zero-element predicate, see [[58-df-chain-complex]])"},{"id":"9ca0b12c56d3a795","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"626a376aca69b0c2","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{ZeroElement}$ 取 [[58-df-chain-complex]] 的同名定义与参数次序。"},{"id":"36fb01abd4e8dac1","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ChainComplex}_S(C,+,\\partial)$ (chain-complex predicate, see [[58-df-chain-complex]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc7